Z||000000||Boomtastic||09-09-2001||09:50 AM||||Note - My apologies to the <B>Twin State Cruisers.</B> I inadvertantly added another state to their club (see Title) without their knowledge.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Congrats to all that made the journey northward and helped with a very good cause (Toys for Tots), and a special "congrats" to Chester & Elvira who walked away with a 2nd place trophy from the show! (Not bad for a show without a Fiero class!) Here's some shots of the show ...<P>3 of The New England Patriots Cheerleaders were on hand. They liked the Fieros. Here they are posing with Fiero5's white 84 SE:<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cheerleaders_3.jpg">    <BR>It looks like the same pic, but the girl on the right is the 3rd cheerleader. We *had* to have her in their too.     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cheerleaders_4.jpg">    <P>Here's the 5 Fieros that made the show:<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_7_1.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_8_1.jpg">    <P>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by Boomtastic (edited 09-09-2001).]||||reg||14
Z||000001||Boomtastic||09-09-2001||09:53 AM||||Closeups of the 5 cars ..<P>Chester's ride<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_1_3.jpg">  <P>Cobra's driver<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_2_3.jpg">  <P>Fiero5's machine<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_4_1.jpg">  <P>Boomtastic's whip<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_5_1.jpg">  <P>LVMY88's cruiser<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_6_1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Boomtastic (edited 09-09-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Boomtastic||09-09-2001||09:57 AM||||Here are Chester & Elvira driving down to get their trophy:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/winners_4.jpg"> <P>Now THAT'S a trophy!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/winners_2.jpg"> <P>I think he was given a choice of the two ..<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/winners_3.jpg"> <P>He took the smaller trophy.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> Here he is with Elvira, and his personal "car wax slave". Now we know the secret to his shine!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/winners_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
