Z||000008||MsBeth||09-09-2001||05:30 PM||||Thanks to Chester and Elvira for the coffee and goodies pre show and the wonderful dinner post show, the food and company made the trip up north even more special. <P>The show was small but fun with plenty of stuff for the kids to do (just ask the Kelley kids  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">).  <P>All to benefit <B>Toys for Tots</B> - can you think of a better reason to attend a show...I sure can't.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>WTG to Chester and Elvira for taking 2nd!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blue_2.gif">  <P>MsBeth||||reg||7
