Z||000010||chester||09-09-2001||08:43 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MsBeth:<BR><B>Thanks to Chester and Elvira for the coffee and goodies pre show and the wonderful dinner post show, the food and company made the trip up north even more special. <P>The show was small but fun with plenty of stuff for the kids to do (just ask the Kelley kids   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">).  <P>All to benefit [b]Toys for Tots</B> - can you think of a better reason to attend a show...I sure can't.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>WTG to Chester and Elvira for taking 2nd!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks to all that came and made it a GREAT time!  We really enjoyed it!  See ya at the next one!<P>Rob & Renee<P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigline.jpg">   <BR>Modified 2.8<BR>2.5" Drop<BR>11" Brakes<BR>17" Revolutions<BR>RCC Coilover Suspension||||reg||1
