Z||000012||Fiero5||09-09-2001||10:10 PM||||Ms. Beth wrote:<BR>"Thanks to Chester and Elvira for the coffee and goodies pre show and the wonderful dinner post show, the food and company made the trip up north even more special."<P>We couldn't agree more! Well said Beth. Helping a great cause and doing with great friends, all with our fun cars  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/icons/icon6.gif"> <P>"The show was small but fun with plenty of stuff for the kids to do (just ask the Kelley kids )."<P>It was great! The kids had a blast! Young AND old alike  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>"All to benefit Toys for Tots - can you think of a better reason to attend a show...I sure can't."<P>Neither can we. That was the real motivation for us going to this one over two other shows that same day! One was even in our back yard in White River Jct. VT, about 15 minutes away.<P>"WTG to Chester and Elvira for taking 2nd!"<P>Yeah, that was an extra special surprise. I even have the announcement and then Rob & Renee getting in and driving the Fiero up to the front all on video.<BR>Of course I have some chearleader girls on video too  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>Steve & Marian||||reg||12
